// Logical ADT: Sequence of integers
// Physical layout: Contiguous memory blocks indexed by offset
int arr[5] = {10, 20, 30, 40, 50};
// Memory address of arr[i] = Base_Address + i * sizeof(int)
// Constant O(1) random access guaranteed by hardware memory bus.

// Nested loops with logarithmic stepping
